{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "57e9085f5d02f0b1b6ed0511434963396386b5a0e78a90e8fafa7c0db2787277", "ja": "月のもとに", "zh": "明月高挂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f674fd07eb6921bbd85e1448fd75606b5611768b6ef745786f74d6013e754996", "ja": "次回公演で新曲を担当する事になった朋花、\n麗花、静香、歩、紗代子の5人。新曲の意外\nな曲調に驚きつつも、『人の心をかき立てる\n月光のような』ステージを目指そうと誓うメ\nンバー5人。本番に向け、練習を開始する。", "zh": "朋花、丽花、静香、步、纱代子这五个人\n将负责在下次公演中唱新歌。新歌出乎意料的\n曲风令五名成员感到吃惊，但她们还是宣誓要\n达成『宛如挑动人心的月光般』的表演，\n并且为了正式演出开始练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dfd6de3dfc4ec9b71d1efe4b08c6d23c92363bd9c551ba3d97ac2f6488834b13", "ja": "（今日は『BlueMoon Harmony!』で\n新曲を担当するメンバーの顔合わせだ……！）", "zh": "（今天是在『BlueMoon Harmony!』中\n负责演唱新歌的成员们的初次会面……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "028305d5e2d86d3893fbfcdd73e86953d9e805a7fc8cc7d3b0d44bda9cbedad2", "ja": "というわけで、今回はここにいるみんなに、公演テーマ\nの新曲『brave HARMONY』を担当してほしい。", "zh": "事情就是这样，这次要请在场的各位\n负责演唱公演主题的新歌『brave HARMONY』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ea0638a86364e57f0e59a5cf7da2c5b8ba9cf750cc0425d9279e42766cda9f41", "ja": "新曲……ホント、{$P$}！？\nイエス、イエース！　やったね！", "zh": "新歌……真的吗？{$P$}！？\nYes！Yes──！太好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "3136e5bbcd2d30de7f7c95a8617c3c090393cc37f1f0d30796bffc42a916b362", "ja": "わーい！　楽しみだな～♪\nみんな、よろしくね！", "zh": "耶～！好期待喔～♪\n大家，请多指教喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "9f3da60998ac967e751ded94260cb7406da31b629f6525afb695cd58dd696fa8", "ja": "はい！\n力を合わせて、いいステージを作りましょう！", "zh": "好的！\n让我们同心协力，打造出最棒的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "206f797d0b2249bf191a41167173d964c16792fc2bd79a288ca212f3cb6af8ca", "ja": "うふふっ。子豚ちゃん達の期待に\n応えなくてはいけませんからね～。", "zh": "唔呵呵！\n可不能辜负了小猪们的期待呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba45125a1b0936fbd172bd31b1c766912b45c3fff6e190b0e0ea5fac38d146e0", "ja": "それで……いったい、どんな曲なんですか？", "zh": "所以……究竟是怎么样的一首歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "21a86f2f4f526f9a6ec4bb26813d49800cd7cc7acf4478b3a126c0eea6b53bae", "ja": "それは聞いてみてのお楽しみだ。\nそれじゃ、オケをかけるぞ！", "zh": "你们听了就知道。\n好，我要放伴奏啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9b2510780a057c4fee58c90e8e134b8e17758c69985122c847f5a56c2b6e3aef", "ja": "へえ、カッコいいじゃん！\n聞いてるだけで、ステップが浮かんでくるよ！", "zh": "哦……听起来很酷耶！\n听着听着，我的脑海就浮现舞步了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "2cf1f37b2f192a77d474a3e8302712f7c9c4489c915eadaabf1751a097e49a06", "ja": "そうですね。思ったよりアップテンポだし、\n月がテーマだけど、疾走感があって。", "zh": "是啊，节奏比想像中来得快。\n虽然是以月亮为主题，但却很有速度感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "435fafe2577109fe86c9a5abc3cb39190f14a8512ccae1fadd1f442112a24837", "ja": "公演の名前が『BlueMoon Harmony!』だから、\nてっきり、もっとゆるやかな曲なのかと思ってました。", "zh": "公演的名称是『BlueMoon Harmony!』，\n我还以为曲调会更和缓一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "3892392f901f3601fa685dfa6fe2f68d5dd8b67d1b3352d6b8909150c135e8b9", "ja": "……確かに月は、ひっそりと夜空に佇むもの。\n穏やかに下界を見守る存在ですが……。", "zh": "……的确，月亮是静静高挂夜空，\n平静守望下界的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b3f921de047f766c9432b5e2492f5bf02b650e0b3642ef5ec10ca3c8baa51ac", "ja": "同時に、美しすぎる月の光は、\n人の心を惑わすとも言いますからね～。", "zh": "不过同时，也有人说太过美丽的月光，\n会迷惑人心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3fc936aaaec60260fec54629c8da0f513c5ed7bfdfd4548ac3481d6468cf0ba4", "ja": "そうそう、どこかミステリアスで魅惑的な、月の光……\nこの曲は、そんな月への憧れを歌ってるのかもな！", "zh": "对对对，月光有种神秘的魅力……\n这首歌要表现的，或许就是对月亮的憧憬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "af60bd251321323a11a3b900b94012e9c2eec8d5d08bcec4d4d79888619d4f51", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそれ、いま考えませんでした？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n你是不是刚刚才想到的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8c8eff4dc392ce98ad5f5427c4067181abce05fb53ba44ec329a7229d47bcfa5", "ja": "……いや、そんなことないぞ？", "zh": "……不不，怎么可能是刚刚才想到的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9f7c6062de9c8a594cf88c067292a6a555f7b60ec8f75c6370bb612063d18e9", "ja": "ふふっ。どちらにせよ私達は、月の光のように\n子豚ちゃん達を照らし、心をかき立てる……。", "zh": "呵呵。无论如何，我们都要像月光一样，\n照耀小猪们，挑动他们的内心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "1ca40b1045744202c0baf727c83840e0526dfc9e96a831762453ad3cfd031437", "ja": "そんなステージを、目指さなければいけませんね～。", "zh": "我们必须努力完成这样的表演呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e42948e84c9dcc42c2fdc13ecee97d0374e3cbda62b37c74ccc61e9ecf69224f", "ja": "月の光のように……かあ。\nなんかムズかしそうだな……。", "zh": "像月光一样啊……\n感觉好困难喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "4eed95eba93adbf57b8c91540aeebbb6756997d30ac03d0c7dfffb5a661a18db", "ja": "あっ。でも、月が綺麗な夜は、\n私もなんだかうきうきしちゃいます♪", "zh": "啊！但是在月色优美的晚上，\n也会让我觉得很兴奋呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "7b78dba4c862b3f939872723660caaff7ffa3bde72a920ae735d04a18cce9203", "ja": "家でじっとしてられなくて、ポーンと飛びだして。\nそのまま歌いながら、遠くまで散歩したり！", "zh": "我会无法一直待在家里，夺门而出。\n就这样一边唱歌一边散步到很远的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "e9750d44166ed135abe155aac6f05ff12d7e9de33bf245f467ef3d576def56f7", "ja": "私も……散歩まではいかなくても、気が付いたら\nぼーっと眺めちゃってたりする気がします。", "zh": "我也是……虽然不会出门散步，\n但有时一回过神才发现自己看月亮看得入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "0e7b4364b6867a4f182f9fe815cdd7e67d29344007504ff63326ac27e525326a", "ja": "そう考えると、月にはいろいろな魅力があるんですね。\nしっかり表現していかないと……。", "zh": "这样一想，月亮确实有许多魅力呢。\n要好好表现出来才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a7870498ed0828aa0bb1d38989733cdebcec604cdc6d3046d86726fc157ab56b", "ja": "確かに、今回は高い表現力を求められるステージに\nなるかもしれないな。でも……。", "zh": "没错，这次的表演可能会需要很高的表现力。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f0112bbc36f63df434aee83ecd33d17ab44ea6f8f764a9fc1d5fb76daa287f30", "ja": "みんなには、その要求に応えるだけの\n充分な実力があると、俺は思ってるんだ。", "zh": "我认为你们大家有足够的实力\n可以达到这个要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "97a9669efb4fc62aa4a831148698020d3478b9dff2086daa07446bb24f7f24b1", "ja": "そう……かな？　へへっ。\nそう言われちゃ、ビビってなんかいられないな。", "zh": "真的……吗？嘿嘿！\n既然你都这么说了，那我们可不能畏缩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "282924ad9fd94e9fac0655e6c62f0eba6bbaafadbadc58e7340f80211c3508d0", "ja": "ええ。任せてください、{$P$}。\n必ず、期待以上のものにしてみせます。", "zh": "是啊，请交给我们吧，{$P$}。\n我们一定会拿出超乎你期待的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7235131b18dd7413f4f2ba3fe8357b91d4ea32e195075e80c6e5c703d8020323", "ja": "はは、頼もしいな。それじゃあ本番目指して、\n一緒に頑張っていこう！", "zh": "哈哈，真是可靠。\n那么就为正式演出做好准备，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "1e7c11d8659f8961fc5d84eaf6899eec1b4e24decc0961df75d21798df859733", "ja": "言われるまでもありません～。\nみなさん、力を合わせて、最高の舞台にしましょうね♪", "zh": "这还用得着说吗～\n大家一起同心协力，打造最棒的演出吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "15eae480b13535b14f85bd952253c002ccb009cf656519e0862431ed31b659ca", "ja": "（曲も決まって、みんな気合いが入ってるな。\n他の公演メンバー共々、頑張ってもらおう！）", "zh": "（歌曲定案了，大家也很有干劲呢。\n和其他公演的成员一起加油吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
